


Baʼii barreessi: ['Number:'].
>> a := Lakkoofsa + Lakkoofsa + 1.
a := Lakkoofsa - 2.
a := Lakkoofsa × 2.
a := Lakkoofsa ÷ 2.
Baʼii barreessi: a.
Baʼii dhaabi.

Baʼii barreessi: ['String:'].
Baʼii barreessi: Barreeffama dheerina.
Baʼii dhaabi.

Baʼii barreessi: ['File:'].
Baʼii barreessi: Faayila dubbisi.
Baʼii barreessi: (Faayila barreessi: ['test']).
Baʼii barreessi: (Faayila dabaliboodatti: ['test']).
Baʼii barreessi: Faayila haqi.
Baʼii barreessi: Faayila jira.
Baʼii barreessi: Faayila include.
Baʼii barreessi: Faayila fiigi.
Baʼii dhaabi.


Baʼii barreessi: ['Array:'].
Baʼii barreessi: Tarree-wantootaa buqqisi.
Baʼii barreessi: Tarree-wantootaa lakkaaʼi.
Baʼii barreessi: (((Tarree-wantootaa dabaliboodatti: 999) gara-barreeffamaatti) bakka-buusi: ['Lĳst'] tiin: ['List']).
Baʼii barreessi: Tarree-wantootaa lakkaaʼi.
Baʼii barreessi: Tarree-wantootaa kaasi.
Baʼii barreessi: (Tarree-wantootaa waliingalchi: [',']).
